AWS DevOps Interview Preparation Series — EBS & EFS 🚀

Topic: Amazon EBS (Elastic Block Store) & Amazon EFS (Elastic File System)

As part of my AWS DevOps Interview Preparation Series, today we’ll explore two essential storage services — EBS and EFS.

 Understanding their differences, use cases, and performance characteristics is vital for designing scalable, reliable, and cost-efficient AWS architectures.

